WEBVTT

00:36:29.270 --> 00:36:31.116
Next time on WorkLife.

00:36:31.140 --> 00:36:33.486
Person: You know, 40
seconds of interaction,

00:36:33.510 --> 00:36:35.236
a positive, caring interaction

00:36:35.260 --> 00:36:38.196
has measurable impacts on both people.

00:36:38.220 --> 00:36:39.655
Forty seconds.

00:36:39.679 --> 00:36:41.386
Forty seconds!

00:36:41.410 --> 00:36:43.733
AG: Ways to tackle loneliness at work.

00:36:44.880 --> 00:36:47.166
WorkLife is hosted by me, Adam Grant.

00:36:47.190 --> 00:36:49.616
The show is produced by TED
with Transmitter Media.

00:36:49.640 --> 00:36:51.816
Our team includes
Colin Helms, Gretta Cohn,

00:36:51.840 --> 00:36:54.826
Dan O'Donnell, Constanza Gallardo,
Grace Rubenstein,

00:36:54.850 --> 00:36:57.786
Michelle Quint, Angela Cheng
and Anna Phelan.

00:36:57.810 --> 00:37:00.116
This episode was produced
by Jessica Glazer.